The dataset analysed by this project is NOT covered by the MIT licence above.

  Social Media Engagement Dataset
  Publisher : aviral342 (Kaggle)
  Source    : https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/aviral342/social-media-engagement-dataset
  Licence   : CC0 1.0 Universal (Public Domain Dedication)

CC0 places the dataset in the public domain, which is what makes this repository
redistributable including the raw CSV. The Kaggle dataset card states the records
are synthetically generated; see docs/strategy_report.md section 6.
